 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 16\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 16\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 1 de Novembro de 2026, com partidas no Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, em Gr\u00e2ndola, distrito de Set\u00fabal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail Ultra de 46 km (08:00), Trail Sprint de 26 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 13.5 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 11 km (09:35).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as fases de pre\u00e7os e as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma oficial StopandGo at\u00e9 16 de Outubro de 2026. O Trail Ultra varia entre 20\u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/08), 25\u20ac (at\u00e9 10\/10) e 35\u20ac (at\u00e9 16\/10). O Trail Sprint varia entre 15\u20ac e 30\u20ac, o Mini Trail entre 12\u20ac e 25\u20ac e a Caminhada entre 10\u20ac e 20\u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para o Trail Ultra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No Trail Ultra (46 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de mochila\/cinto de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o (m\u00ednimo 1 litro), manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito, verificados na c\u00e2mara de chamada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es em tempo real com tempos interm\u00e9dios e finais estar\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma StopandGo e partilhadas no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, Gr\u00e2ndola\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Gr\u00e2ndola\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Gr\u00e2ndola e Clube Amiciclo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 1 de Novembro de 2026, com partidas no Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, em Gr\u00e2ndola, distrito de Set\u00fabal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui o Trail Ultra de 46 km (08:00), Trail Sprint de 26 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 13.5 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 11 km (09:35).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as fases de pre\u00e7os e as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma oficial StopandGo at\u00e9 16 de Outubro de 2026. O Trail Ultra varia entre 20\u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/08), 25\u20ac (at\u00e9 10\/10) e 35\u20ac (at\u00e9 16\/10). O Trail Sprint varia entre 15\u20ac e 30\u20ac, o Mini Trail entre 12\u20ac e 25\u20ac e a Caminhada entre 10\u20ac e 20\u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para o Trail Ultra?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No Trail Ultra (46 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de mochila\/cinto de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o (m\u00ednimo 1 litro), manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito, verificados na c\u00e2mara de chamada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es em tempo real com tempos interm\u00e9dios e finais estar\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma StopandGo e partilhadas no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":53521,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[48,728,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-53520","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-grandola-setubal","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-setubal","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Cartaz-com-distancias-e-Inscricoes-abertas.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.po